tinacloud-auth-status(1) -- Display TinaCloud account status
============================================================

## DESCRIPTION

Display authentication status and TinaCloud account information.

## SYNOPSIS

`tinacloud auth status`

## OPTIONS

  * `--json`:
    Print the result as JSON

## EXAMPLES

Show the account currently signed in to TinaCloud:

	$ tinacloud auth status

Use the JSON result in a script:

	$ tinacloud auth status --json

